 ## Implemented geometry (offline only)
 
-- `hoop_guide.rods` defines straight and circular-arc centerline segments, a
-  composable `RodModel`, and the first model for A1/A2. The two variants
-  have the same nominal 200 mm straight rod; their motion differs.
