-- `hoop_guide.geometry` defines plate-to-robot transformations and a generic
-  flange-to-hoop adapter transform. The real adapter dimensions and mounting
-  orientation are NOT calibrated, so no real robot trajectory is provided.
-- Selecting A1 or A2 in the existing menu prints geometry preview status.
-  B, C, and D remain unavailable pending verification against CAD drawings.
